<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE -- Oct M3 data due shortly.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE -- Oct M3 data due shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it would release provisional German M3 money supply data for October shortly.</p>
<p>M3 grew at an annualised rate of 8.4 percent in September, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank's target range for 1995 M3 money supply growth is four percent to seven percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
